    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator CO-OP \u2013 Your Path to the Top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an advanced fitness simulator with a co-op mode, allowing you to play with up to 4 friends. Work together to achieve your goals or compete to see who comes out on top \u2013 the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/917cbe5de5419d7de8a5772821f07040.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/917cbe5de5419d7de8a5772821f07040.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your character</strong> using a detailed character creator where you can adjust body fat and muscle levels to closely match your own appearance. Additionally, the game lets you upload a photo of your face to make your character even more personal and lifelike. To add variety, you can also randomize genetic predispositions for developing different muscle groups, making your character truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/fb1e79197acfe7badcaec69e67329d5a.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/fb1e79197acfe7badcaec69e67329d5a.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>realistic anatomical system</strong> accurately simulates muscle and tendon movements, ensuring every workout looks and feels natural. Your character will dynamically respond to your decisions, diet, and training. Train properly, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with the perfect physique. However, neglect your training or focus on unbalanced muscle development, and you\u2019ll quickly notice the effects \u2013 not just in appearance but also in your character\u2019s proportions and overall aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget about your character\u2019s <strong>mental state</strong>, which also impacts workout efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/d1584619113b28b53a9bfc2bcbc114ae.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/d1584619113b28b53a9bfc2bcbc114ae.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>photo mode</strong>, allowing you to capture and share pictures of your character\u2019s progress with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to gym workouts and competing on the fitness stage, you can try your hand at other activities, such as martial arts, billiards, or darts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money through memberships, conduct personal training sessions, keep your gym in order, expand it by purchasing new equipment, and build your fitness empire. Become the king of the fitness world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodybuilder Simulator CO-OP \u2013 Your Path to the Top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an advanced fitness simulator with a co-op mode, allowing you to play with up to 4 friends. Work together to achieve your goals or compete to see who comes out on top \u2013 the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/917cbe5de5419d7de8a5772821f07040.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/917cbe5de5419d7de8a5772821f07040.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your character</strong> using a detailed character creator where you can adjust body fat and muscle levels to closely match your own appearance. Additionally, the game lets you upload a photo of your face to make your character even more personal and lifelike. To add variety, you can also randomize genetic predispositions for developing different muscle groups, making your character truly unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/fb1e79197acfe7badcaec69e67329d5a.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/fb1e79197acfe7badcaec69e67329d5a.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>realistic anatomical system</strong> accurately simulates muscle and tendon movements, ensuring every workout looks and feels natural. Your character will dynamically respond to your decisions, diet, and training. Train properly, and you\u2019ll be rewarded with the perfect physique. However, neglect your training or focus on unbalanced muscle development, and you\u2019ll quickly notice the effects \u2013 not just in appearance but also in your character\u2019s proportions and overall aesthetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget about your character\u2019s <strong>mental state</strong>, which also impacts workout efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/d1584619113b28b53a9bfc2bcbc114ae.poster.avif?t=1753227871\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485580/extras/d1584619113b28b53a9bfc2bcbc114ae.webm?t=1753227871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>photo mode</strong>, allowing you to capture and share pictures of your character\u2019s progress with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to gym workouts and competing on the fitness stage, you can try your hand at other activities, such as martial arts, billiards, or darts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money through memberships, conduct personal training sessions, keep your gym in order, expand it by purchasing new equipment, and build your fitness empire. Become the king of the fitness world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Our game is a realistic fitness simulator with a co-op mode. Collect trophies, earn money, and shape your physique! Your character dynamically reacts to diet and training, reflecting real physical changes. Take on the challenge with friends and strive for peak fitness!",
